        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "SDK-reported processor errors (including queue-full drops). An absent error counter is shown as zero only while the corresponding SDK queue gauge is present. Missing SDK telemetry remains a gap; this does not account for every possible downstream loss. The zero fallback requires a fresh gauge from the newest selected process."
    },
