    {
      "id": 32,
      "title": "Backoff coverage",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 117
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### What these panels count\n\n- **Schedules** and **suppressed checks** are retry decisions, not unique resources.\n- **Recovered** clears a cooldown; **reset** requests re-evaluation.\n- **Deferred entries** may still apply other healthy work.\n\nThere is no active-cooldown gauge yet, so these panels do not claim how many guilds are currently blocked. Unused event series may have no data; check telemetry freshness above.\n\nOpen a log entry below for retry delay, failure/suppression counts and its correlated trace. Guild/member/channel IDs remain outside metric labels and exported event attributes."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "title": "Recent permission decisions",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 125
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_name=\"$service\",service_instance_id=~\"$instance\",event_name=~\"permission_retry_(scheduled|recovered|reset)\"} | line_format \"{{.event_name}} \u00b7 {{.operation}} \u00b7 {{.reason}}{{if .retry_after_seconds}} \u00b7 retry={{.retry_after_seconds}}s{{end}} \u00b7 suppressed={{.suppressed}}\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "maxLines": 100
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "prettifyLogMessage": false
      },
      "description": "Recent scheduled, recovered and reset decisions. Expand log details for failure counts, suppression counts and trace correlation. Retry delay describes that scheduling decision, not a live countdown."
